Package: winIPCW
Title: Restricted Win Statistics with Conditional Tie Weighting
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xi", "Fang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "xi.fang@example.com"),
    person("Fan", "Li", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Estimates restricted-time win statistics for hierarchical or
    prioritized composite survival outcomes under right censoring. The package
    targets restricted win probabilities at a prespecified clinical horizon and
    implements both the verified-tie inverse probability of censoring weighting
    (IPCW) estimator and a modified IPCW estimator with conditional tie
    weighting. The modified estimator uses conditional probabilities of
    higher-priority genuine ties to recover partially observed lower-priority
    comparisons that would otherwise be discarded as censoring-induced ties.
    Summary measures include the win ratio, net benefit, and win odds, with
    Wald-type confidence intervals based on two-sample U-statistic projection
    variance estimators.
